{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Mosine 是一款以每日重溫帶動相片清理的 iPhone 工具，適合相片庫日漸臃腫、想分批整理舊回憶的用戶。它每日展示歷年同一天拍攝的相片，讓你重溫、保留值得留念的內容，並批次刪除其餘相片。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-44.webp\">\n<h2>每日重溫歷年今日相片</h2>\n<p>Mosine 會按日期展示歷年同一天拍攝的相片，讓你重溫並保留值得留念的內容。你可逐張或按年份選取不再需要的相片，經 iOS 確認後批次刪除；刪除項目會留在「最近刪除」約 30 天。介面手勢貼近原生相片 App，支援標記喜好、分享、可選每日提醒及清理統計，相片不會離開裝置。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-288-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-289-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-290-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-291-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Mosine</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T13:00:41.909086+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":310,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T12:56:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T20:18:20.762231+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T12:57:40.135227+00:00","content_hash":"009b54bc722d65fb88ac59f7f4f791a22dad64f0f8ae6cff6501006502af3eec","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}